{"id":"343af549f6fb6f36","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-distributional-bounded-halting.md","title":"Distributional Bounded Nondeterministic Halting","display":"df-distributional-bounded-halting — Distributional Bounded Nondeterministic Halting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-distributional-bounded-halting","aliases":["28-df-distributional-bounded-halting"],"display":"df-distributional-bounded-halting — Distributional Bounded Nondeterministic Halting","depends_on":["[[28-df-ntm]]","[[28-df-computation]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 18.8, separator-complete fixed-length encoding","source_printed_pages":"367","source_pdf_pages":"393","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-distributional-bounded-halting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-distributional-bounded-halting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-distributional-bounded-halting — Distributional Bounded Nondeterministic Halting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 18.8, separator-complete fixed-length encoding"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"367"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"393"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；固定有限转移表编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:\\mathrm{NTM}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\eta:\\mathrm{NTM}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，有效码可在码长多项式时间识别并解码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTM},\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x),\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\">\\(\\mathrm{NTM},\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x),\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge8\">\\(n\\ge8\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_n=\\lfloor\\log_2n\\rfloor\">\\(k_n=\\lfloor\\log_2n\\rfloor\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_n=\\lceil\\log_2(k_n+1)\\rceil\">\\(b_n=\\lceil\\log_2(k_n+1)\\rceil\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_n=n-b_n-k_n-1\">\\(r_n=n-b_n-k_n-1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{b}(m)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_{b}(m)\\)</span> 为宽b二进制编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_k=\\bigcup_{j=0}^k\\Sigma^j\">\\(E_k=\\bigcup_{j=0}^k\\Sigma^j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in E_{k_n}\">\\(e\\in E_{k_n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le t\\le r_n\">\\(0\\le t\\le r_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^{r_n-t}\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^{r_n-t}\\)</span>；不同三元组编码互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^U_n\">\\(D^U_n\\)</span> 在编码像外取零。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\\)</span> 定义在全部比特码上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\ [e=\\eta(M)\\land\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\ \\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\ [e=\\eta(M)\\land\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\ \\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_n(e,x,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{b_n}(|e|)\\ e\\ 0^{k_n-|e|}\\ x\\ 0\\ 1^t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_n(e,x,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{b_n}(|e|)\\ e\\ 0^{k_n-|e|}\\ x\\ 0\\ 1^t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\coloneqq\\{c_n(e,x,t):n\\ge8,\\ e\\in E_{k_n},\\ 0\\le t\\le r_n,\\ x\\in\\Sigma^{r_n-t},\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\coloneqq\\{c_n(e,x,t):n\\ge8,\\ e\\in E_{k_n},\\ 0\\le t\\le r_n,\\ x\\in\\Sigma^{r_n-t},\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D^U_n(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1[z=0^n]&amp;n&lt;8,\\\\\\displaystyle\\frac{2^{-|x|}}{(2^{k_n+1}-1)(r_n+1)}&amp;n\\ge8,\\ z=c_n(e,x,t),\\\\0&amp;n\\ge8,\\ z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(c_n).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D^U_n(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1[z=0^n]&amp;n&lt;8,\\\\\\displaystyle\\frac{2^{-|x|}}{(2^{k_n+1}-1)(r_n+1)}&amp;n\\ge8,\\ z=c_n(e,x,t),\\\\0&amp;n\\ge8,\\ z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(c_n).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书忽略分隔符。本地补全用固定宽度码长字段、机器码补零、末尾分隔0与一元时间，使总长恰n且可唯一解码：末尾连续1决定t，机器长度由首字段给出。先均匀选择所有长≤k的机器比特码，再均匀t，再均匀x；无效机器码仍进入分布但判为否实例。对所有e,t,x求和等于1，小长度单独给点分布。机器码的具体有效序列化是明示表示参数，未声称原书逐位使用此编码。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 18.8, separator-complete fixed-length encoding；印刷页 367；PDF 页 393。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第18章的 Distributional Bounded Nondeterministic Halting，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；固定有限转移表编码 $\\eta:\\mathrm{NTM}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*$，有效码可在码长多项式时间识别并解码；$\\mathrm{NTM},\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x),\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)$ 见 [[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；固定有限转移表编码 $\\eta:\\mathrm{NTM}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*$，有效码可在码长多项式时间识别并解码；$\\mathrm{NTM},\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x),\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)$ 见 [[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-computation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:\\mathrm{NTM}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTM},\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x),\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge8","display":false},{"tex":"k_n=\\lfloor\\log_2n\\rfloor","display":false},{"tex":"b_n=\\lceil\\log_2(k_n+1)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"r_n=n-b_n-k_n-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_{b}(m)","display":false},{"tex":"E_k=\\bigcup_{j=0}^k\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in E_{k_n}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le t\\le r_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Sigma^{r_n-t}","display":false},{"tex":"D^U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\ [e=\\eta(M)\\land\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\ \\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le t].","display":true},{"tex":"c_n(e,x,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{b_n}(|e|)\\ e\\ 0^{k_n-|e|}\\ x\\ 0\\ 1^t.","display":true},{"tex":"U\\coloneqq\\{c_n(e,x,t):n\\ge8,\\ e\\in E_{k_n},\\ 0\\le t\\le r_n,\\ x\\in\\Sigma^{r_n-t},\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\le t}(e,x)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"D^U_n(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1[z=0^n]&n<8,\\\\\\displaystyle\\frac{2^{-|x|}}{(2^{k_n+1}-1)(r_n+1)}&n\\ge8,\\ z=c_n(e,x,t),\\\\0&n\\ge8,\\ z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(c_n).\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":2879,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-p-computable-distribution]]、[[28-df-p-samplable-distribution]]、[[28-df-distributional-levin-reduction]]、[[28-df-distnp]]、[[28-df-distributional-bounded-halting]]、[[28-thm-levin-distnp-completeness]]。"},{"id":"c60a910dfdfc76dc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U,D^U$ 使用 [[28-df-distributional-bounded-halting]] 的固定有效有限转移表编码；其解码和有限运行检验在描述与一元步数的多项式时间完成。"}],"outgoing":["e6357334ccd3589d","256220eba4eba968"]}